  "Prosperity": "Wohlstand", "{#}% gold earned.": "{#} % verdientes Gold.", "Recovery": "Genesung", "{#}% to every hero after each room.": "{#} % für alle Helden nach jedem Raum.", "No maximum: each level costs more.": "Kein Maximum: jede Stufe kostet mehr.",
